    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hentai Collection: Memory is the first in our planned series of simple relaxing puzzle games focusing on simplistic gameplay and design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Hentai Collection: Memory you play memory puzzles that grow in size as you get further into the game. After every puzzle you unlock pictures of sexy girls that get more lewd as you go along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After beating all puzzles you get access to randomly generated puzzles of all shapes and sizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the gallery you can see all images you unlocked in full size and replay the games associated with the image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tMore than 45 campaign puzzles all with unique images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 + Cyberpunk _2069 (november 2022)\u00a0 with more than  40 puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 + Into the Fairy Glade (april 2025) with more than 40 puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tExciting voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tView unlocked images and replay finished puzzles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tPlay randomly generate puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tScale to any resolution (Even in landscape and portrait mode) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tWith adjustable background music, dialog and sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recently we added a 'Hint' button to complete puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301970/extras/cf2ad4f0f6f5a0ee56212a7b7ad5806d.av